{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩押的难民逃到犹大"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你们当将羊羔奉给那地掌权的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从西拉往旷野，送到锡安城","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"的山。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的居民","poem":1},{"noteId":16},{"text":"在亚嫩渡口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像游飞的鸟，如拆窝的雏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你献谋略，行公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的影子在午间如黑夜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隐藏被赶散的人，不可显露逃民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你容我这被赶散的人和你同居。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于摩押，求你作他的隐密处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脱离灭命者的面。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勒索人的归于无有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭的事止息了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺压人的从国中除灭了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有宝座因慈爱坚立；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有一位诚诚实实坐在其上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大卫帐幕中施行审判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻求公平，速行公义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我们听说摩押人骄傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是极其骄傲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听说他狂妄、骄傲、忿怒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他夸大的话是虚空的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，摩押人必为摩押哀号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都要哀号。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们摩押人要为吉珥·哈列设的葡萄饼哀叹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"极其忧伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"因为希实本的田地","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和西比玛的葡萄树都衰残了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的君主折断其上美好的枝子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这枝子长到雅谢延到旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嫩枝向外探出，直探过盐海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要为西比玛的葡萄树哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与雅谢人哀哭一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希实本、以利亚利啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以眼泪浇灌你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为有交战呐喊的声音","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"临到你夏天的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并你收割的庄稼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从肥美的田中夺去了欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在葡萄园里必无歌唱，也无欢呼的声音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹酒的在酒榨中不得踹出酒来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他欢呼的声音止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我心腹为摩押哀鸣如琴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心肠为吉珥·哈列设也是如此。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["摩押人朝见的时候，在高处疲乏，又到他圣所祈祷，也不蒙应允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["这是耶和华从前论摩押的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但现在耶和华说：「三年之内，照雇工的年数，摩押的荣耀与他的群众必被藐视，余剩的人甚少无几。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":1}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}